<p>President Trump said on March 21 that he could send Immigration and Customs Enforcement agents into US airports as early as Monday if Democrats do not agree to fund the Department of Homeland Security. A partial shutdown has left Transportation Security Administration staff working without pay for weeks. Multiple reports said TSA personnel are set to miss a second full paycheck on March 27, and some officers have been calling in sick, raising concerns about airport delays and staffing strain. The threat came during a standoff over DHS funding. Democrats have refused to back a bill unless immigration enforcement policies change, while the White House has pushed for stronger security and enforcement measures. Politico reported that the White House shared concessions with Senate Democrats on Friday, suggesting there is still a possible path to a deal even as the risk of airport disruption grows.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/9RWBganOP1UKlwK7kkTJxWJbQ1I-kVOJzdcTpiSl4VMsNeyijoTE-gLihUBnpnFaz6TrpbVubTz9Q1cdtsyAFaSEoBlIUanybbJjR3xzyfMEeSOjSfqoBrgi2jCEJtH4G9i3_oHcSffhRY16cfjV3X7F1jGHZuqgR3HF9nKWdP7Ais5dwO4Anw1fonGhhb6pGvQsiObXAx8mmiNNRHbTlE6r4LLrZYFp2HdePOmCUihQ8GZu9oV22ulPueYAs3HWFfdvULjPcI8qf7tHJg' alt='Travellers wait in Transportation Security Administration screening lines at the San Antonio International Airport in San Antonio, Tex., on March 14.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Arrest pledge: Trump said ICE agents at airports would not just “do security” but also immediately arrest undocumented immigrants.</li><li>Somalia emphasis: In the same social media posts, Trump said enforcement would put heavy emphasis on immigrants from Somalia, according to Politico and Al Jazeera.</li><li>Senate obstacle: The immediate trigger was another Senate failure to advance a homeland security funding bill, The Guardian reported, extending the shutdown standoff.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Trump: He said ICE could step into airport security during the shutdown and used that threat to argue that Democrats were leaving airports unsafe. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c3ex9nq2qywo'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Congressional Democrats: They are using DHS funding as leverage to push for changes in how the department handles immigration enforcement, making this a policy fight as much as a dispute over pay and staffing. (<a href='https://www.politico.com/news/2026/03/21/trump-ice-airports-tsa-dhs-00839340'>Politico</a>)</li><li>White House: The administration paired Trump&#x27;s public Monday ultimatum with concessions quietly shared with Senate Democrats on Friday, suggesting it is escalating and negotiating at the same time. (<a href='https://www.politico.com/news/2026/03/21/trump-ice-airports-tsa-dhs-00839340'>Politico</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/trump-threatens-to-put-ice-agents-in-airports-over-funding-impasse'>Trump threatens to put ICE agents in airports over funding impasse</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3347448/trump-threatens-put-ice-agents-airports-amid-tsa-funding-clash'>Trump threatens to put ICE agents in US airports amid TSA funding clash</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/mar/21/trump-threatens-to-send-ice-agents-to-airports-unless-dhs-deal-reached'>Trump threatens to send ICE to airports on Monday amid DHS funding standoff</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c3ex9nq2qywo'>Trump threatens to send ICE into airports unless funding deal reached</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-trump-ice-airports-dhs-funding-impasse/'>Trump threatens to put ICE agents in U.S. airports amid partial government shutdown</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/21/trump-threatens-to-deploy-ice-to-airports-amid-homeland-security-shutdown'>Trump threatens to deploy ICE to airports amid Homeland Security shutdown</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/ice-officers-soon-will-help-with-airport-security-unless-democrats-end-shutdown-trump-says/article70771393.ece'>ICE officers soon will help with airport security unless Democrats end shutdown, Trump says</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.politico.com/news/2026/03/21/trump-ice-airports-tsa-dhs-00839340'>Trump threatens to send ICE to airports amid DHS standoff</a> - politico.com</li></ul>